Hi {Owner},

I build websites for acupuncture and traditional medicine clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has kind reviews, but nowhere a new patient can read what a first acupuncture visit is like, what cupping involves or what a course of treatment costs.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a first-visit page, cupping and herbal sections, fees and packages, and online booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It makes no health claims; it explains the visit, your training and your fees. If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes between patients?

